@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080/api/v1

### Login as the Development-only parent
# @name parentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"parent.test@example.invalid","password":"ArtKids-Test-2026!"}

### Paste the accessToken from the response (Swagger Authorize also accepts it)
@token = REPLACE_WITH_PARENT_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@instructorToken = REPLACE_WITH_INSTRUCTOR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Children
GET {{baseUrl}}/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Courses (public catalogue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&pageSize=20

### Child progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/progress?childId=child-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consent before uploading a drawing
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childId":"child-1","purpose":"data_processing","policyVersion":"1"}

### Submit after multipart /media/upload returns an asset ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/kid/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childId":"child-1","lessonId":"lesson_basics_1","imageAssetId":"REPLACE_WITH_ASSET_ID"}

### Teacher's assigned submissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/kid/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

### Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/kid/submissions/REPLACE_WITH_SUBMISSION_ID/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":9.5,"feedback":"Nét vẽ rõ, phối màu đẹp."}

### Checkout: all prices and stock are computed by the server
POST {{baseUrl}}/commerce/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"idempotencyKey":"manual-test-order-001","items":[{"itemType":"kit","itemId":"prod_kit_animal","quantity":2}],"voucherCode":"ARTKIDS10","shipping":{"recipientName":"Nguyen Test Parent","phoneNumber":"0900000000","fullAddress":"1 Test Street"},"paymentMethod":"manual_transfer"}

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/commerce/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrator manually verifies payment / confirms COD
POST {{baseUrl}}/commerce/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a live class (instructor owns course_basics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/live/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"courseId":"course_basics","name":"Lớp vẽ tối thứ Bảy","capacity":30}

### Enroll child in a live class
POST {{baseUrl}}/live/classes/REPLACE_WITH_CLASS_ID/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childId":"child-1"}

### Create a session: replace dates with future UTC times and use your actual meeting provider URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/live/classes/REPLACE_WITH_CLASS_ID/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Buổi 1","startsAt":"2026-12-05T12:00:00Z","endsAt":"2026-12-05T13:00:00Z","lessonId":"lesson_basics_1","provider":"external","roomUrl":"https://meet.example.invalid/replace-with-real-room"}

### Join is available 15 minutes before a session or while marked live
POST {{baseUrl}}/live/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"childId":"child-1"}
